SUMMARY:Community Wellness Fair hosted by Community Market and community partners
DESCRIPTION:Join Community Market at our annual Community Wellness Fair for a full day of wellness\, learning\, self-care\, and community connection. \nThis year’s fair brings together local practitioners\, educators\, makers\, and wellness-focused businesses for a day centered around care\, discovery\, and well-being. Guests will have the opportunity to explore a wide range of offerings\, including one-on-one wellness services\, educational speakers\, local vendors\, a curated wellness boutique\, food\, drinks\, and more. \nThe Community Wellness Fair is a chance to connect with local wellness providers\, learn about different approaches to health and well-being\, discover new resources\, and spend time in community. Whether you are looking for support\, inspiration\, education\, or simply a meaningful way to spend the day\, the fair offers something for anyone interested in wellness and self-care. \nAttendees can browse vendor booths\, meet practitioners\, enjoy wellness services\, listen to speakers\, shop thoughtfully selected products\, and learn more about the people and organizations offering wellness resources in our community. \nMore details about participating vendors\, services\, speakers\, and offerings will be shared soon. \nEvent Details\nSaturday\, August 1\n11 AM to 5 PM\nSEB Arts\n282 S. High Street\, Sebastopol\, CA \nTickets\nAdvance tickets are $10 through July 27.\nTickets will be $15 at the door. \nFor more information or to purchase tickets\, visit cmnaturalfoods.com/cwf-tickets.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/community-wellness-fair-hosted-by-community-market-and-community-partners-2/
LOCATION:282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally,Education,Health
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/CWF-SQUARE-1.png
END:VEVENT
