SUMMARY:Orchard Hike with Brooke Hazen at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Don’t just tour the farm — explore it alongside the very farmer who built it\, Brooke Hazen\, in this immersive\, behind-the-scenes experience. \nStep into the heart of Gold Ridge Organic Farms for an orchard hike led by our founder and farmer\, Brooke Hazen. With over two decades of dedication poured into these 88 acres of certified organic farmland\, Brooke will guide you through the orchards and share the story of how he transformed this land into a thriving sanctuary for heirloom apples\, olives\, and citrus. \nAlong the way\, you’ll explore our 70+ heirloom apple varieties and 21 olive cultivars\, learn about our organic farming practices\, and get your questions answered by the person who knows this land better than anyone \nPlease Note:\nThis is a moderately challenging walk over uneven\, rugged terrain with gentle hills and light elevation gain. Sturdy\, closed-toe\, non-slip shoes are required. No heels\, sandals\, ballet flats\, or open-toed shoes allowed. \nWhat to Bring:\n*Sun Protection: Sunscreen and a sun hat\n*Water: A refillable bottle — we offer pristine well water for top-ups\n*Layers: Mornings are cool and afternoons can be warm — a T-shirt with a light jacket works well \nAfter the hike\, enjoy a capsule tasting of our most popular and best beloved apple and olive products\, including our Tuscan Blend EVOO\, Apple Cider Syrup and more!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/orchard-hike-with-brooke-hazen-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Brooke-standing-in-orchard-4-scaled.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Gold Ridge Organic Farms":MAILTO:info@goldridgeorganicfarms.com
END:VEVENT
