SUMMARY:The Keys to Health\, Peace\, and Freedom - A Presentation by Dr Will Tuttle at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Are you concerned about the quality of food available today? \nAre you troubled by the high rates of chronic disease in our society? \nWould you like to understand the hidden roots of the dilemmas we face as individuals and a society\, and to learn new skills for healthier\, more sustainable living? \nAre you interested in practical keys to radiant health? \nAuthor of international best-seller\, The World Peace Diet\, as well as the companion books The World Peace Way and Food for Freedom\, Dr. Will Tuttle delivers an inspiring talk about our culture’s food systems and shares his wisdom regarding practical tools to reduce our environmental footprint\, make healthy lifestyle choices\, and improve our relationships\, with one another and the world. Dr. Tuttle and his spouse Madeleine will guide us toward building radiant health\, optimizing our wellness and joy\, and building a positive future for all. DIscover the knowledge for self-healing\, physically\, socially\, culturally\, psychologically\, and spiritually! \nQ & A session and discussion to follow. Don’t miss the chance to get your signed copies of The World Peace Diet and The World Peace Way – books will be for sale with the author available for signing. \nDr Will Tuttle\, visionary educator\, musician\, and author of the international best-seller\, The World Peace Diet\, published in 16 languages\, has lectured and performed in over 50 countries. A featured expert in Cowspiracy and other documentary films\, he’s a recipient of the prestigious Courage of Conscience Award. A former Zen monk and Dharma Master in the Zen tradition\, he is the author of several books and has created 10 much-loved CD albums of original piano music. His inspiring presentations often include his music as well as evocative animal and nature paintings by his spouse\, Madeleine\, visionary artist from Switzerland\, who is also a flutist\, Waldorf teacher\, organic gardener\, and vegan chef. Visit www.worldpeacediet.com to learn more about their work.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-keys-to-health-peace-and-freedom-a-presentation-by-dr-will-tuttle-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Will-Tuttle.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Gold Ridge Organic Farms":MAILTO:info@goldridgeorganicfarms.com
END:VEVENT
