SUMMARY:Irish Tunes Class with Suzuki Cady
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, August 3\, 5:00-6:15pm in Sebastopol (address upon sign-up). Taught by local fiddler Suzuki Cady of the band Hardly Strictly Irish. \nMulti-level class open to all melody instruments. \nDrink herbal tea\, learn the tune of the week by ear (that was introduced in advance\, with a recording link supplied) along with some technique coaching (if desired). \nContact Suzuki at 415-302-9658 | suzukicady@gmail.com | https://suzukicady.com/class
