SUMMARY:The Art of Visible Mending: Woven Darning
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to repair clothing with woven darning—a functional and beautiful technique especially suited for knitwear. This workshop covers material selection\, setting up a darn\, and weaving strong\, expressive patches. \nIn this workshop you’ll:\n• Choose yarns and materials for woven darning\n• Set up and weave a stable darn\n• Explore design choices for creative\, visible repairs\n• Bring a garment to mend\, or use provided samples. \nMaterials included; no experience required.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-visible-mending-woven-darning/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/VisibleMending-Darning-2.png
END:VEVENT
