SUMMARY:Beginner Knitting Next Steps: Sophie Scarf
DESCRIPTION:Ready for your first knitting project? In this hands-on workshop\, you’ll knit the beloved Sophie Scarf by PetiteKnit while learning the skills that take you beyond the basics. It’s a quick\, satisfying project that’s perfect to wear\, gift\, and knit again. \nIn this workshop you’ll:\n• Learn how to read and follow a knitting pattern\n• Practice increases and decreases while shaping your scarf\n•Build the skills and confidence to take on future knitting projects \nDesigned for students who are comfortable with the knit stitch and basic knitting skills. Materials available for purchase at Gather.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/beginner-knitting-next-steps-sophie-scarf/2026-08-04/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Beginning-knitting-next-steps.png
END:VEVENT
