SUMMARY:Gravenstein Apple Fair 2026
DESCRIPTION:The more\, the merrier ~ many hands make light work! \nThe Gravenstein Apple Fair is made possible by the enthusiasm of dedicated volunteers who work together to make the Fair a success each year. We will have a wide range of volunteer opportunities before\, during\, and after the Fair. \nVolunteers receive an official Gravenstein Apple Fair apron\, free weekend admission\, an invitation to our Volunteer Appreciation Party\, and our sincere gratitude! \nHop aboard and become a volunteer! We have a variety of shifts available for all age ranges and skill sets. \nSIGN UP HERE or email lauren@farmtrails.org for more information.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/gravenstein-apple-fair-2026/
LOCATION:Ragle Ranch Regional Park\, 500 Ragle Road\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Agriculture,All Ages (Family friendly),Entertainment/Culture,Festivals,Fundraiser
